  "description": "Code-first gRPC transport binding and strongly-typed client for Orleans.Lattice.Api.TenantAdmin. Exposes the tenant-administration control facade (create, suspend, resume, and delete-with-tree-cascade) over a remote gRPC surface, with a default-deny authorization interceptor and an unauthenticated auth-scheme discovery RPC. Fail-closed: every lifecycle RPC is rejected until the host opts in.",
